Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I've been so stiff lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then shall I give you a massage?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it. That feels incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.26,0:00:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I was designed to soothe my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.33,0:00:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do erotic massages as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's locked behind master registration—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.66,0:00:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope! A normal one's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I really so unworthy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.46,0:00:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hate me, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.84,0:00:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's busting out the tears! I must resist!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that. You're just too human-like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.78,0:00:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Look, registering as your master \Nwould make me your owner, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.61,0:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But I can't treat you like property \Nwhen you look like a human girl.{sgt: ugh, I'm sure there's a better way to write this scene.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.54,0:01:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how am I supposed to serve you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Saying you're human-like is a compliment! \NYou're not useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.46,0:01:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,sex is something that two humans do together!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.26,0:01:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.38,0:01:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, not that I know much about love or sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never dated or been in a physical relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.48,0:01:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The most I've done is hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.19,0:01:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Anyway, I just think \Nthat we should start as friends first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.26,0:01:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to be my friend, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't call me "Master."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.66,0:01:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do I call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.65,0:01:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.21,0:01:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.15,0:01:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.94,0:01:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,May I kiss you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.45,0:01:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.14,0:01:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You got upset when I suddenly kissed you last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't quite get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.77,0:02:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I mean, I kiss her every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.78,0:02:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.93,0:02:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.81,0:02:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane. Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.42,0:02:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When she whispers my name like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.63,0:02:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it's like she's my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you please make me feel good, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you're trying to make me register, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.38,0:03:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it! You are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let my guard down with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I just... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.81,0:03:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you mad at me, Akane?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.88,0:03:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko, can you feel pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sort of. I'm programmed to avoid damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I would've felt awful if I'd hurt her.{sgt: ugh.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to do more sometime, Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.73,0:04:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hearing her say my name is sweet agony.
